    "body": "What I would try would be to:\r\n\r\n1.  Make sure you're using a document that does back/forward caching.\r\n2. Load a page in a tab.\r\n3. Have that page open a new window and load a page with a subframe in it.\r\n4. Grab a reference to the subframe's window.\r\n5. Navigate the window that's the parent of the subframe to a new URL.\r\n6. Call setTimeout on the subframe.",
